  "description": "Memory and GC telemetry for ASP.NET Core apps, intended for Xperience by Kentico SaaS environments, to get more robust statistics than the Xperience Portal provides: GC and memory metrics, a probe that reports what is pinned in the heap, a watchdog that compacts the heap and, if switched on, restarts the app before the host kills the process, start and stop markers, and forwarding to your own Application Insights resource. Has no dependency on the Kentico SDK.",
